            "body": "Hi! Thanks for suggestion!\r\nI originally was inspired by 'mucomplete', but deliberately made a choice to implement only two-stage completion (chained one with two particular sources). Unfortunately, I don't see many customizable completion sources being implemented in 'mini.completion'.",
