        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Yeah, I really like the plugin because is very minimal and doesn't have too many bells and whistles, but it will be nice having the option to at least have also path completion. Like implementing in a way that kicks in only when u type `/`.\n\nBut I will not insist any longer if you like the way is now. ",
